sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller (HilbertNeighborStore / GaRunner)
    participant Lead as GrpcLeadStore
    participant Client as LeadClient<Channel>
    participant Remote as lead.Lead service

    Note over Caller,Remote: 1. Store Gene (PutRouted)
    Caller->>Lead: store_gene(key, value)
    Lead->>Client: clone()
    Lead->>Client: put_routed(PutRoutedRequest { key, value })
    Client->>Remote: /lead.Lead/PutRouted
    alt success
        Remote-->>Client: BoolMsg { ok: true }
        Client-->>Lead: Ok(())
        Lead-->>Caller: Ok(())
    else failure
        Remote-->>Client: Status error
        Client-->>Lead: Err(Status)
        Lead-->>Caller: Err(Status)
    end

    Note over Caller,Remote: 2. Get Gene (GetRouted)
    Caller->>Lead: get_gene(key)
    Lead->>Client: clone()
    Lead->>Client: get_routed(KeyMsg { key })
    Client->>Remote: /lead.Lead/GetRouted
    alt found
        Remote-->>Client: ValMsg { value }
        Client-->>Lead: Ok(Some(value))
        Lead-->>Caller: Ok(Some(value))
    else NotFound
        Remote-->>Client: Status::NotFound
        Client-->>Lead: Ok(None)
        Lead-->>Caller: Ok(None)
    end

    Note over Caller,Remote: 3. Range Query (RangeQuery)
    Caller->>Lead: range_query(start_key, count)
    Lead->>Client: clone()
    Lead->>Client: range_query(RangeRequest { start_key, count, caller_address })
    Client->>Remote: /lead.Lead/RangeQuery
    Remote-->>Client: RangeResponse { entries }
    Client-->>Lead: Ok(entries)
    Lead-->>Caller: Ok(Vec<(String, String)>)

